@startuml 架构时序图-学生申请审核完整链路
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #1890ff
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #e6f7ff
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam linetype ortho

title 架构时序图：学生申请审核完整跨层调用链路

actor "学生" as Student
box "表示层" #e6f7ff
  participant "StudentJobs.vue" as Vue1
  participant "request.js\n(Axios拦截器)" as Axios
end box
box "业务层" #f6ffed
  participant "ApplicationController" as Ctrl
  participant "ApplicationService" as Svc
  participant "NotificationService" as NotifySvc
end box
box "数据层" #fff7e6
  participant "ApplicationMapper" as Mapper
  participant "NotificationMapper" as NotifyMapper
end box
database "MySQL" as DB

actor "部门管理员" as DeptAdmin
box "表示层" #e6f7ff
  participant "DepartmentApplications.vue" as Vue2
end box

== 学生投递申请 ==
Student -> Vue1: 点击"投递"按钮
Vue1 -> Axios: POST /api/applications\n{jobId, resumeUrl, coverLetter}
Axios -> Axios: 请求拦截器\n自动附加 JWT Token
Axios -> Ctrl: HTTP POST (Bearer Token)
Ctrl -> Svc: applyForJob(dto)
Svc -> Mapper: countByUserAndJob(userId, jobId)
Mapper -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*)
DB --> Mapper: 0 (未重复投递)
Svc -> Mapper: insert(application)
Mapper -> DB: INSERT INTO job_application
DB --> Mapper: OK
Mapper --> Svc: success
Svc --> Ctrl: success
Ctrl --> Axios: Response {code:200, data:null}
Axios -> Axios: 响应拦截器\n统一错误处理
Axios --> Vue1: 响应数据
Vue1 --> Student: 提示"投递成功"

== 部门审核申请 ==
DeptAdmin -> Vue2: 进入申请审核页面
Vue2 -> Axios: GET /api/applications?deptId=X
Axios -> Ctrl: HTTP GET
Ctrl -> Svc: listByDept(deptId, page)
Svc -> Mapper: selectPage(deptId)
Mapper -> DB: SELECT * FROM job_application
DB --> Mapper: 申请列表
Mapper --> Svc: Page<Application>
Svc --> Ctrl: PageResult
Ctrl --> Axios: Response {code:200, data: PageResult}
Axios --> Vue2: 分页数据
Vue2 --> DeptAdmin: 展示申请列表

DeptAdmin -> Vue2: 点击"通过" + 安排面试时间
Vue2 -> Axios: PUT /api/applications/{id}\n{status:1, interviewTime:...}
Axios -> Ctrl: HTTP PUT
Ctrl -> Svc: auditApplication(id, dto)
Svc -> Mapper: updateById(application)
Mapper -> DB: UPDATE job_application SET status=1
DB --> Mapper: OK
Svc -> NotifySvc: createNotification(studentId, "申请已通过")
NotifySvc -> NotifyMapper: insert(notification)
NotifyMapper -> DB: INSERT INTO notification
DB --> NotifyMapper: OK
NotifyMapper --> NotifySvc: success
NotifySvc --> Svc: 通知已生成
Svc --> Ctrl: success
Ctrl --> Axios: Response {code:200}
Axios --> Vue2: 成功
Vue2 --> DeptAdmin: 提示"审核完成"

@enduml
